{"product_id":"naughtiest-girl-1-naughtiest-girl-in-the-school","title":"Naughtiest Girl 1: Naughtiest Girl In The School","description":"\u003cp\u003eElizabeth Allen is spoilt and selfish. When's she's sent away to boarding school she makes up her mind to be the naughtiest pupil there's ever been! But Elizabeth soon finds out that being bad isn't as simple as it seems ...Bonus material in these new editions include:A rare, complete serial story about a very special school.An interview with Enid Blyton about her school days.Enid Blyton's experiences as a teacher.A timeline of the author's life.Photos from Enid Blyton's younger days.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 197\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Enid Blyton\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781444918823\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 128\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45675015078041,"sku":"1RA9781444918823","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ab4f6d8073a_Naughtiest_Girl_1-_Naughtiest_Girl_In_The_School_Enid_Blyton.jpg?v=1756278791","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/naughtiest-girl-1-naughtiest-girl-in-the-school","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}